# Nothing generated under mediator/identity/ is committed (criterion 9, R8.7).
#
# Private key material is the obvious half. The certificates are excluded too: each listener
# certificate carries an iPAddress SAN for one deployment's mediator address, so a committed
# copy would be wrong for every other operator host and would invite reuse instead of issuance.
# Regenerate with `bash scripts/issue-identity.sh` -- see README.md.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
